.so fork.tmac
.PP
.pt_jd_ParseError
.RS 4
.PP
The structure by which
.B jd_parse_file
notifies a calling function that an error occurred while parsing a
given file.
.TP
.I char_loc
is the absolute position in the JSON file of the character that broke
the syntax rules.  The indicated character often follows the error.
For example, a missing comma may only be noticed when another string
begins before a comma separates it from its sibling.
.TP
.I message
is a description of the error.
.RE

